  "question": {
    "text": "The ratio of speed of sound in hydrogen gas to the speed of sound in oxygen gas at the same temperature is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$4: 1$",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$1: 2$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$1: 4$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$1: 1$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given $\\mathrm{M}_{\\mathrm{H}_2}=2 ; \\mathrm{M}_{\\mathrm{O}_2}=32$<br />Speed of sound, $\\mathrm{v}=\\sqrt{\\frac{\\gamma \\mathrm{RT}}{\\mathrm{M}}}$<br />$\\Rightarrow \\quad v \\propto \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{M}}$<br />$\\therefore \\quad \\frac{\\mathrm{v}_{\\mathrm{H}_2}}{\\mathrm{v}_{\\mathrm{O}_2}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{\\mathrm{M}_{\\mathrm{O}_2}}{\\mathrm{M}_{\\mathrm{H}_2}}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{32}{2}}=4: 1$"
  }
}